Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 14:58:34 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat(semantics): prototype UID contexts and core
 contraction lowering

Authoring-only detached prototype. Resolve bare UID strings with explicit full slot domains and prove read-product and nested core-reduction interpretation over a generic semiring. Positional valuation equivalence is not yet a UID-keyed valuation theorem.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
